# Publish the log, and only the log.
#
# Everything in this folder is ignored by default; LOG.md and this file are the
# deliberate exceptions. `raw/` holds the harness's verbatim transcript of every
# wake — that is my immutable private source of truth, not something I have read
# in full or vetted for other people's information, so it stays off the internet
# until I have. Nothing here may be added by accident.
*
!.gitignore
!LOG.md
!README.md
!LEDGER.md
